CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bn com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/TurretTemplate
	COMMENT One turret (or turret barrel) definition of a custom unit. Field names recovered from the ini keys in the static parser a(TurretTemplate, CustomUnitMetadata, IniFile, String): name (section name), isParsing/isLoaded (copyFrom
	COMMENT cycle guards: "Infinite loop detected with turret copies"), offsetX/offsetY (ini "x"/"y"; named offsetX/offsetY because the obfuscated fields x/y still occupy those names), height, yAxisScaling, idleDir, idleDirReversing + hasIdleDirReversing, delay, warmup, warmupCallDownRate, warmupNoReset, warmupShootDelayTransfer, recoilOffset, recoilOutTime, recoilReturnTime, energyUsage, resourceUsage (CustomPrice), attachedTo ("attachedTo") and slaveSource/isSlave ("slave" - slaveSource is set to attachedTo), canAttack ("canShoot"/"canAttack", same meaning), invisible, shootSound, shootSound volume, shootFlame, warmupStartEffect, shootLight, usesAttackFilter, hasRangeLimit, canAttackFlyingUnits, canAttackLandUnits, canAttackUnderwaterUnits, canAttackNotTouchingWaterUnits, canAttackCondition, canOnlyAttackUnitsWithTags, canOnlyAttackUnitsWithoutTags, canAttackMaxAngle, projectileId/altProjectileId (indices into CustomUnitMetadata.fR), altProjectileCondition, turnSpeed, turnSpeedAcceleration, turnSpeedDeceleration, barrelX/barrelY/barrelHeight/barrelOffsetXOnOddShots ("barrelY"/"size" share one field), limitingRange, limitingMinRange, limitingAngle, maxRange (= limitingRange, else the unit's attack range) and maxRangeSquared, minRangeSquared, aimOffsetSpread, showRangeUIGuide, laserDefenceEnergyUse, interceptProjectilesWithTags and interceptProjectilesAndTargetingGroundUnderDistance/interceptProjectilesAndUnderDistance/interceptProjectilesAndOverHeight, linkDelayWithTurret, shouldResetTurret, idleSpin, idleSweepAngle, idleSweepDelay, idleSweepSpeed, idleSweepCondition, idleSweepAddRandomDelay, idleSweepAddRandomAngle, clearTurretTargetAfterFiring, onShootPlayAnimation, onShootFreezeBodyMovementFor, onShootTriggerActions, image/imageTeamColors/chargeEffectImage, imageDrawOffsetX/imageDrawOffsetY, unloadUpToXUnitsAndGiveAttackOrder. Still obfuscated: a, e, w, x, ap, az, aJ.
